# NOTE ON THE EXPORTED FRAMES
# assets/frames/*.atlasframe IS committed so the sandbox runs from a fresh
# checkout without needing the datasets mounted (~3.5 MB total).
#
# Those files are derived from KITTI (CC BY-NC-SA) and nuScenes, whose terms
# restrict redistribution. BEFORE PUSHING THIS ANYWHERE PUBLIC, either confirm
# redistribution of derived point clouds is permitted or uncomment the line
# below and rely on tools/export_frames.py to regenerate them locally.
# assets/frames/*.atlasframe
